<<<
The traps laid by WHAT are so many & various (What puzzles us most are the references to .. ., &c.) that it is better to refer the reader to that word.
===
The traps laid by ^^WHAT^^ are so many & various (*What puzzles us most are the references to* . . ., &c.) that it is better to refer the reader to that word.
>>>

